{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"zombie","model_identifier":"zombie","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# zombie\n\nZombie (C1), walker, 1.7 m = 60 u standing (stoops to about 56 u in its clips).\n\nA dead villager of the old kingdom: grey-green skin, sunken sockets with dull yellow eye lights, slack hinged jaw, torn earth-stained tunic with a ragged skirt, one arm always reaching forward. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus a `jaw` bone.\n\n- Cubes: 22 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.0..11.0, y 0.0..60.0, z -5.0..4.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 58 x 16 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -2, from y = 0 (stooped, reaching arm forward)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop | swaying, jaw working, right arm reaching |\n| `walk` | 1.5 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `attack_grab` | 1.5 | once | key 0.7 s: the bite (two-handed lunge and clamp 0.55 s, bite 0.7 s, chews, back to idle) |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | head back, moan, arms jerk out |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | topples forward on its face, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.3 | loop | writhing/stumbling in sunlight (loop); smoke and fire are game effects |\n| `rise` | 2.8 | once | claws its way out of the ground (root starts 64 u below y = 0); for hollow_priest raise_dead |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 19.6 u/s (0.55 m/s), cycle 1.5 s, 29.3 u per cycle (shamble)\n- `run`: 74.7 u/s (2.10 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 59.7 u per cycle (lurching run, both arms out)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_grab`: key 0.7 s: the bite (two-handed lunge and clamp 0.55 s, bite 0.7 s, chews, back to idle)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 60, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 42, 5.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 46, 5.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5, 51.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 40, -5.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 27.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12.5, 34.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 27.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (7, 31, 3)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-7, 31, 3)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `zombie_woman.png`: a woman in a knitted shawl (shawl over shoulders and upper arms, paler hair)\n- `zombie_soldier.png`: an old soldier in a rusty mail shirt\n\n## Notes\n\n- Default texture is the farmer.\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n- Burns in sunlight (all walking dead have `burn`).\n"},"description":"# zombie\n\nZombie (C1), walker, 1.7 m = 60 u standing (stoops to about 56 u in its clips).\n\nA dead villager of the old kingdom: grey-green skin, sunken sockets with dull yellow eye lights, slack hinged jaw, torn earth-stained tunic with a ragged skirt, one arm always reaching forward. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names plus a `jaw` bone.\n\n- Cubes: 22 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.0..11.0, y 0.0..60.0, z -5.0..4.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 58 x 16 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -2, from y = 0 (stooped, reaching arm forward)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop | swaying, jaw working, right arm reaching |\n| `walk` | 1.5 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `attack_grab` | 1.5 | once | key 0.7 s: the bite (two-handed lunge and clamp 0.55 s, bite 0.7 s, chews, back to idle) |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | head back, moan, arms jerk out |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | topples forward on its face, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.3 | loop | writhing/stumbling in sunlight (loop); smoke and fire are game effects |\n| `rise` | 2.8 | once | claws its way out of the ground (root starts 64 u below y = 0); for hollow_priest raise_dead |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 19.6 u/s (0.55 m/s), cycle 1.5 s, 29.3 u per cycle (shamble)\n- `run`: 74.7 u/s (2.10 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 59.7 u per cycle (lurching run, both arms out)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_grab`: key 0.7 s: the bite (two-handed lunge and clamp 0.55 s, bite 0.7 s, chews, back to idle)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 60, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 42, 5.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (3, 46, 5.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (5, 51.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 40, -5.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 27.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12.5, 34.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 27.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (7, 31, 3)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-7, 31, 3)\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `zombie_woman.png`: a woman in a knitted shawl (shawl over shoulders and upper arms, paler hair)\n- `zombie_soldier.png`: an old soldier in a rusty mail shirt\n\n## Notes\n\n- Default texture is the farmer.\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit eye cubes.\n- Burns in sunlight (all walking dead have `burn`).\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.0,28.0,-3.5],"to":[6.0,33.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,28.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null},"east":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null},"south":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null},"west":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null},"up":{"uv":[51,28,63.0,35.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[63,28,75.0,35.0],"texture":0}},"